WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:08.500
Speaker 1: OK, let's talk about what is increasingly
likely going to be the addition of the covid-19

00:00:08.500 --> 00:00:13.200
vaccine to school requirements, school vaccination
requirements.

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:18.230
If kids want to go to public schools now,
why am I wording it this way?

00:00:18.230 --> 00:00:24.339
Because most states, every state already has
a list of vaccines that are required for students

00:00:24.339 --> 00:00:25.720
to attend public school.

00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:28.269
And we're going to talk about this in some
detail.

00:00:28.269 --> 00:00:33.790
The news that is getting people all worked
up is a report that Dr. Anthony Fauci backs

00:00:33.790 --> 00:00:37.410
a covid-19 mandate for U.S. schoolchildren.

00:00:37.410 --> 00:00:41.760
Reuters reporting on this, choosing a terrible
picture of Anthony Fauci looking like he's

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:44.160
doing a Nazi salute.

00:00:44.160 --> 00:00:46.430
Why this picture was chosen, I don't know.

00:00:46.430 --> 00:00:51.040
But the report from Reuters is Dr. Foushee,
top U.S. infectious disease expert, said Sunday

00:00:51.040 --> 00:00:56.320
he supports covid vaccine mandates for children
attending schools as the highly contagious

00:00:56.320 --> 00:01:02.290
delta variant of the coronavirus continues
to fuel a surge in cases in the nation.

00:01:02.290 --> 00:01:08.640
Let's take a look at Dr. Fauci himself saying
yesterday on CNN, remembering, of course,

00:01:08.640 --> 00:01:11.740
that children under 12 aren't even eligible
yet.

00:01:11.740 --> 00:01:15.570
This is Dr. Dr. Fauci saying what he would
support.

00:01:15.570 --> 00:01:18.880
But the vaccine isn't even approved for kids
under 12 yet.

00:01:18.880 --> 00:01:19.880
Let's take a look.

00:01:19.880 --> 00:01:24.480
Speaker 2: I believe that mandating vaccines
for children to appear in school is a good

00:01:24.480 --> 00:01:25.480
idea.

00:01:25.480 --> 00:01:28.740
And remember, Jake, this is not something
new.

00:01:28.740 --> 00:01:34.420
We have mandates in many places and schools,
particularly public schools, that if, in fact,

00:01:34.420 --> 00:01:36.330
you want a child to come in.

00:01:36.330 --> 00:01:43.190
We've done this for decades and decades requiring
polio, measles, mumps, rubella, hepatitis.

00:01:43.190 --> 00:01:48.380
So this would not be something new, requiring
vaccinations for children to come to school.

00:01:48.380 --> 00:01:54.409
Speaker 1: So this makes sense and it's really
not even remotely controversial.

00:01:54.409 --> 00:01:57.340
We're just adding a vaccine.

00:01:57.340 --> 00:02:01.650
We would be if this happened, we would just
be adding another vaccine to the list of vaccines

00:02:01.650 --> 00:02:03.850
that are required for public school kids.

00:02:03.850 --> 00:02:08.369
This is a vaccine that the Fizer vaccine is
now approved by the FDA.

00:02:08.369 --> 00:02:13.749
And part of what the right does is create
fear and outrage and uncertainty and doubt

00:02:13.749 --> 00:02:15.290
over noncontroversial things.

00:02:15.290 --> 00:02:16.560
And this is good.

00:02:16.560 --> 00:02:20.629
These are going to be the next battle lines
if you look at the state of Texas.

00:02:20.629 --> 00:02:26.799
A bill was introduced in the Texas legislature
to add the covid vaccine to the.

00:02:26.799 --> 00:02:32.450
A required school vaccine list, there was
another bill introduced in Texas that goes

00:02:32.450 --> 00:02:38.919
directly counter, which would ban adding the
covid vaccine as a required vaccine for schools.

00:02:38.919 --> 00:02:40.769
So we're going to see where that goes in Texas.

00:02:40.769 --> 00:02:45.400
Texas, of course, has a right wing legislature
and it will probably be the latter rather

00:02:45.400 --> 00:02:46.400
than the former.

00:02:46.400 --> 00:02:53.069
But it is important to remember that a whole
bunch of states already have these rules.

00:02:53.069 --> 00:02:57.159
Let's start with the liberal state of New
York.

00:02:57.159 --> 00:03:04.160
When you look at New York, you see very clearly
you need the DTP vaccine.

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:07.590
That's diphtheria, tetanus and pertussis.

00:03:07.590 --> 00:03:13.349
If you're going to pre-K, you need four doses
for kindergarten through age, through grade

00:03:13.349 --> 00:03:14.659
five.

00:03:14.659 --> 00:03:19.400
You need five or four doses or three, depending
on the age of the kids.

00:03:19.400 --> 00:03:28.799
For grades six to 12, you need three doses
of the DTP polio vaccine, three doses or four.

00:03:28.799 --> 00:03:31.569
Based on the age MMR.

00:03:31.569 --> 00:03:34.840
Kids in pre-K need a dose of MMR.

00:03:34.840 --> 00:03:36.900
Everybody beyond that needs two doses.

00:03:36.900 --> 00:03:39.439
Hep B is on the list.

00:03:39.439 --> 00:03:43.499
Varicella chickenpox vaccine now required.

00:03:43.499 --> 00:03:48.730
Once you get to grade seven, you need the
meningococcal vaccine, OK?

00:03:48.730 --> 00:03:53.819
The point here is New York already has a list
of all of these vaccines.

00:03:53.819 --> 00:03:55.639
There just there's no new structure.

00:03:55.639 --> 00:03:57.709
It's just add the covid vaccine to that.

00:03:57.709 --> 00:04:02.930
Now, if you say, well, sir, New York, very
liberal state, let's look instead at the state

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:04.099
of Alabama.

00:04:04.099 --> 00:04:10.749
Alabama, if you look, also has this requirement
and it's kind of strict look at this, the

00:04:10.749 --> 00:04:16.489
state of Alabama does not recognize philosophical,
moral or ethical exemption from vaccination.

00:04:16.489 --> 00:04:22.400
A medical exemption may be issued by a physician
or an Alabama religious exemption may be obtained.

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:26.319
Some states have even done away with religious
exemptions, but Alabama is already pretty

00:04:26.319 --> 00:04:27.319
tight on this.

00:04:27.319 --> 00:04:28.930
And then look at the list.

00:04:28.930 --> 00:04:33.430
Attendee's of day care and Head Start must
be vaccinated against diphtheria, tetanus,

00:04:33.430 --> 00:04:40.270
pertussis, measles, mumps, rubella, influenza,
type B, polio and chicken pox.

00:04:40.270 --> 00:04:45.870
We're just talking about adding one more vaccine
and I could go on and give you more requirements

00:04:45.870 --> 00:04:47.130
for older kids.

00:04:47.130 --> 00:04:53.480
So when we talk about this issue, it's really
important not to let them frame the battle

00:04:53.480 --> 00:04:58.770
lines as we're going from nothing to mandating
a vaccine.

00:04:58.770 --> 00:05:05.400
No, we're going in theory from mandating six
or seven vaccines to adding a seventh or eighth

00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:08.110
that's just been approved by the FDA.

00:05:08.110 --> 00:05:13.659
Don't let them set the terms of the debate
and we will ultimately see where this goes.

00:05:13.659 --> 00:05:17.830
But remember, it's not even approved for kids
under 12 yet.

00:05:17.830 --> 00:05:21.009
There is the next step would be five to 11.

00:05:21.009 --> 00:05:23.199
And that's being evaluated right now.

00:05:23.199 --> 00:05:27.790
This is going to be a fight, but it's going
to be a necessary one, sadly, because of the

00:05:27.790 --> 00:05:31.159
level of ignorance that we have in the United
States.

